==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|по-|ду́мать}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|поду́мать}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-подумать.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|поду́мать|pf|impf=ду́мать}}

# to [[think]] ({{non-gloss|for a while}}), to [[have]] a [[think]], to [[consider]],  to [[reflect]], to [[ponder]]
# to [[arrive]] at a [[thought]], to [[conclude]], to [[figure]]
#: {{ux|ru|[[но|Но]] [[я]] '''поду́мал''', [[что]] [[же́нщины]] [[постоя́нно]] [[меня́ют]] [[своё]] [[мне́ние]].|But then I '''thought''', women change their minds all the time.}}
#: {{ux|ru|[[Я]] '''поду́мал''', [[что]] [[бу́дет]] [[непло́хо]] [[провести́]] [[ве́чер]] [[с]] [[друзья́ми]].|I '''figured''' it wouldn't be so bad to spend the night with friends.}}
# to [[decide]], to [[think]] ({{non-gloss|to do something}}), to [[arrive]] at an [[idea]] ({{non-gloss|with a verb in the infinitive}})
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] '''поду́мал''' [[позвони́ть]] [[в]] [[дверь]].|I '''thought''' I'd ring the bell.}}

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|pf|1a+p|поду́мать}}

{{C|ru|Thinking}}
